{"page":317,"verses":[{"verse_key":"20:77","surah":20,"ayah":77,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَىٰ مُوسَىٰٓ أَنْ أَسْرِ بِعِبَادِى فَٱضْرِبْ لَهُمْ طَرِيقًا فِى ٱلْبَحْرِ يَبَسًا لَّا تَخَـٰفُ دَرَكًا وَلَا تَخْشَىٰ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We revealed to Moses, ‘Go out at night with My servants and strike a dry path for them across the sea. Have no fear of being overtaken and do not be dismayed.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And verily","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"We inspired","transliteration":"awḥaynā","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مُوسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنْ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَسْرِ","en_gloss":"Travel by night","transliteration":"asri","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِعِبَادِى","en_gloss":"with My slaves","transliteration":"biʿibādī","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَٱضْرِبْ","en_gloss":"and strike","transliteration":"fa-iḍ'rib","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":10,"ar":"طَرِيقًۭا","en_gloss":"a path","transliteration":"ṭarīqan","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْبَحْرِ","en_gloss":"the sea","transliteration":"l-baḥri","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَبَسًۭا","en_gloss":"dry","transliteration":"yabasan","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":15,"ar":"تَخَـٰفُ","en_gloss":"fearing","transliteration":"takhāfu","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":16,"ar":"دَرَكًۭا","en_gloss":"to be overtaken","transliteration":"darakan","verse_key":"20:77"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","vers