en_gloss":"(80)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"20:80"}]},{"verse_key":"20:81","surah":20,"ayah":81,"ar_uthmani":"كُلُوا۟ مِن طَيِّبَـٰتِ مَا رَزَقْنَـٰكُمْ وَلَا تَطْغَوْا۟ فِيهِ فَيَحِلَّ عَلَيْكُمْ غَضَبِى ۖ وَمَن يَحْلِلْ عَلَيْهِ غَضَبِى فَقَدْ هَوَىٰ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"‘Eat from the good things We have provided for you, but do not overstep the bounds, or My wrath will descend on you. Anyone on whom My wrath descends has truly fallen.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"Eat","transliteration":"kulū","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":3,"ar":"طَيِّبَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"(the) good things","transliteration":"ṭayyibāti","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَزَقْنَـٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"We have provided you","transliteration":"razaqnākum","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَطْغَوْا۟","en_gloss":"transgress","transliteration":"taṭghaw","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَيَحِلَّ","en_gloss":"lest should descend","transliteration":"fayaḥilla","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":11,"ar":"غَضَبِى ۖ","en_gloss":"My Anger","transliteration":"ghaḍabī","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَحْلِلْ","en_gloss":"on whom descends","transliteration":"yaḥlil","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"on whom descends","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":15,"ar":"غَضَبِى","en_gloss":"My Anger","transliteration":"ghaḍabī","verse_key":"20:81"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"indeed","transliteration":"