s":4,"ar":"فَتَنَّا","en_gloss":"We (have) tried","transliteration":"fatannā","verse_key":"20:85"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَوْمَكَ","en_gloss":"your people","transliteration":"qawmaka","verse_key":"20:85"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after you","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"20:85"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَعْدِكَ","en_gloss":"after you","transliteration":"baʿdika","verse_key":"20:85"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأَضَلَّهُمُ","en_gloss":"and has led them astray","transliteration":"wa-aḍallahumu","verse_key":"20:85"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلسَّامِرِىُّ","en_gloss":"the Samiri","transliteration":"l-sāmiriyu","verse_key":"20:85"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٨٥","en_gloss":"(85)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"20:85"}]},{"verse_key":"20:86","surah":20,"ayah":86,"ar_uthmani":"فَرَجَعَ مُوسَىٰٓ إِلَىٰ قَوْمِهِۦ غَضْبَـٰنَ أَسِفًا ۚ قَالَ يَـٰقَوْمِ أَلَمْ يَعِدْكُمْ رَبُّكُمْ وَعْدًا حَسَنًا ۚ أَفَطَالَ عَلَيْكُمُ ٱلْعَهْدُ أَمْ أَرَدتُّمْ أَن يَحِلَّ عَلَيْكُمْ غَضَبٌ مِّن رَّبِّكُمْ فَأَخْلَفْتُم مَّوْعِدِى","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Moses returned to his people, angry and aggrieved. He said, ‘My people, did your Lord not make you a gracious promise? Was my absence too long for you? Did you want anger to fall on you from your Lord and so broke your word to me?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَرَجَعَ","en_gloss":"Then Musa returned","transliteration":"farajaʿa","verse_key":"20:86"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مُوسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"Then Musa returned","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"20:86"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"20:86"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَوْمِهِۦ","en_gloss":"his people","transliteration":"qawmihi","verse_key":"20:86"},{"pos":5,"ar":"غَضْبَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"angry","transliteration":"ghaḍbāna","verse_key":"20:86"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَسِفًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"(and) sorrowful","transliteration":"asifan","verse_key":"20:86"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"20:86"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"O my people","transl